让我分析这段 PHP 代码：

```php
$a = [1, 2, 3];
foreach ($a as &$v) {}
$v = 99;
echo implode(',', $a);
```

1. `$a = [1, 2, 3]` - 数组 $a 包含 [1, 2, 3]
